name issue_700_neteq_v2_high_jitter_seed3
describe issue_62_neteq_v2_high_jitter on seed 3, where our jb_delay_p95_ms reaches 190 against libwebrtc's 180 (issue #700); traced on both stacks
seed 3
duration 30s
neteq v2
at 0s capacity=3000kbps delay=30ms jitter=40ms reorder=on queue=300ms
expect audio.interruptions == 0
expect audio.concealed_pct < 0.5
expect audio.jb_delay_p95_ms >= 95
# Measurement copy (#700): ours 190 on this seed, libwebrtc 180 (#697), so it carries no upper line; issue_62_neteq_v2_high_jitter keeps <= 180.
